{"id":"ahorro","lemma":"ahorro","pos":"noun","rank":3765,"glosses":["saving (money that is saved)"],"ipa":"/aˈoro/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ahorros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-ahorro.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tengo una cuenta de ahorros.","en":"I have a savings account.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"count, tally"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Tengo mucho dinero en mi cuenta de ahorro.","en":"I have a lot of money in my savings account.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/932217","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"much"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"count, tally"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Me gustaría abrir una cuenta de ahorros.","en":"I'd like to open a savings account.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599006","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to open, open up"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"count, tally"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Él guarda todos sus ahorros en el banco.","en":"He keeps all his savings in the bank.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"guard, ward, keeper"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"bank"}]},{"text":"Gasté todos mis ahorros en esto.","en":"I spent all the savings I had on this.","words":[{"g":"to spend","l":"gastar"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this"}]}]}